{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "067005c9-a987-57a9-9c7d-45cf65b3f374", "source_ordinal": 2510, "reading_ordinal": 1543, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "受够了", "published_at": "2022-11-26T22:05:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/328563416/answer/2776168303"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "受够了，于是呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你可以“受够了考试不及格，于是干脆弃考”，也可以“受够了考试不及格，认真起来，考及格”。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你可以“受够了减肥总是失败，不减了”，也可以“受够了减肥总是失败，减成功”。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“受够了”既可以成为前一种动力，但也可以成为后一种动力。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你受够了生活的苦，你要“不活了”，还是要让生活不再苦？", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "往往当你听见“受够了”这个话的时候，往往是来自前一种人。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你“受够了”，然后呢？", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“受够了”难道给了你什么可以无视规则和规律的神奇免罪金卡吗？", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "受够了，于是打人就没罪吗?", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "还是上岗可以免考？招聘可以免试？还是摸电门可以免麻，跳水可以免沉？", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "heading", "index": 11, "text": "会因为你“受够了”而给你额外资源的，只有你的父母亲人以及害怕你伤人的好人。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "换言之，“受够了”是一把只对好人、亲人有效的武器，就像所有的抱怨一样。", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "heading", "index": 13, "text": "它生来就是欺负自己人用的。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "除非你打算做“受够了考试不及格，一咬牙考及格”的人，否则“受够了”三个字最好少说。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "说了，谁听到，你最好回头跟谁道歉。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "否则你的社会地位会飞速的下降。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为受够了这话，你跟谁说，谁都不免要给你三分宽待。不要误以为得到这三分宽待你是赚了。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因为受宽待和受尊敬是矛盾的。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "受人尊敬的人受的是优待、敬待，不是宽待。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "俘虏和罪犯受的，才叫宽待。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 532}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24, "heading": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我已经受够了生活的苦，怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“受够了”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“受够了，于是呢？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "受够了，于是呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9e220057-0cc7-5fba-9db6-66dbe57f6b70", "source_ordinal": 2509, "reading_ordinal": 1544, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "反服从性的人", "published_at": "2022-11-27T00:52:14+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/60197709/answer/2776356083"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "别的不多说了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "警惕教你们把服从视为懦弱、把管理视为压迫的人。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“服从即懦弱”是一种典型的反社会人格，真正执行起来就是一切都可以扯出理由来不合作，而且罪还在你。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这种人根本无法信任和托付。", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta只不过永远有理由把ta不爽且看出你不爽的事帮你论证为不正义、不正当。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实ta们的论证不堪一击，甚至都没什么资格得到“一击”——你要ta实践，ta那个天花乱坠的理论自己就垮了。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "别的不说，问问这些革命导师——如果服从性就是人格缺陷、服从就是自由的失败，那么请问你对下属的不服从是什么安排？", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你怎么解决一个组织的内部协调问题？", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "还是你认为人类的组织是多余的？", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "heading", "index": 10, "text": "不要纸上谈兵。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "事情坏在——你不爽了，你顾不了那么多了，谁说你是对的你就要跟谁混了——你自己要和ta里应外合。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "结果注定一地鸡毛。", "char_start": 335, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "一个人摆出“服从即懦弱”的样子，倒是不需要“抗争”啥了——因为没人敢来“剥削和压迫”了。", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这些用怜悯的口吻谈论服从性的人，说话肯定很中小孩子的听，但却不是小孩子们的朋友。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "ta们倒未必是故意的，只是在做让ta们自己最爽的事情，顾不得你的死活而已。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你记住——", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "heading", "index": 17, "text": "既不能令，又不受命，是绝人也。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这里显然不是指“绝妙的人”。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 509}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24, "heading": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何培养自己的抗争精神？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“反服从性的人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“别的不多说了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "别的不多说了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d2ded333-2c24-5153-b1cc-ebf291d534a7", "source_ordinal": 2508, "reading_ordinal": 1545, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "WORKER", "published_at": "2022-11-28T00:51:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/525273331/answer/2777702915"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "There is a certain kind of happiness that I hope you will not miss: being a WORKER.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "I do not mean labor, nor job, affair, business, or even duty.", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "I mean, please, work on something hard, persistently, with resilience, to the limit, and go beyond those limits.", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "A worker is not “a person who lives on salary.”", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "NO, NOT AT ALL.", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "A worker is a person who makes something work, just like a cooler is a tool that makes something cool.", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "“Coincidentally”, making something work is exactly the very work of GOD, which makes every common worker, even the most insignificant one, a true colleague of the world's creator.", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "It’s the second most incredible honor a mortal being can hope and reach for, right after a man of charity, which is becoming the likes of GOD.", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "Some day, you will understand it preserves an even greater value than life itself, so “there is no satisfying return” is not a good enough reason to abandon this pursuit.", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 919}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "It’s one of the greatest JOYs you should not miss.", "char_start": 920, "char_end": 970}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "If you have 3 million in your bank account, what you have is actually 3 million reasons to enjoy it most dearly and eminently.", "char_start": 971, "char_end": 1097}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "If you don’t have that money, or hell, broke as shit, you have an even more obvious reason to work.", "char_start": 1098, "char_end": 1197}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "Focus on the true nature of work, it will provide.", "char_start": 1198, "char_end": 1248}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "The world is hard-wired that way to make sure every colleague of his is cared for.", "char_start": 1249, "char_end": 1331}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "Sadly, those who “bear labor for bread” are not considered as one of them.", "char_start": 1332, "char_end": 1406}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "They are bearing labor alright,but they rarely have that “bread.”", "char_start": 1407, "char_end": 1472}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：三百万放银行吃利息，我可以不用上班吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“WORKER”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“There is a certain kind of happiness that I hope you will not miss: being a WORKER.”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "There is a certain kind of happiness that I hope you will not miss: being a WORKER.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 83, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b135816f-3eca-5597-9056-a923e93d17f3", "source_ordinal": 2507, "reading_ordinal": 1546, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "扩建医院", "published_at": "2022-11-30T03:24:21+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/569548867/answer/2780830740"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "老胡的治理经验有哪些？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "在我看来，这个问题只有很少的几种人有说话的余地——", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）有治理经验的地方官员。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）医学、疾控专业人士。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "3）建筑专业人士。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "4）有运营、管理经验的专业管理者。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "没有这类实务经验，你根本不能正确的估计成本和效益。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不能大概靠谱的估计成本和收益，你就约等于闭着眼睛胡说八道。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "他这整个论述里有大量经不住基本质疑的断言，连被投入严肃的资源进行讨论的资格也没有。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "别的不说，“扩建正规医院”这条。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有没有考察一下，现在的医院都在哪？", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "绝大多数医院都在中心城区，周围都修满了居民区。尤其是一线好医院，甚至大多都在老城区。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "毕竟，政府大楼、邮政局、公安局和医院是任何一个行政区最先建立的四个设施。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "那都是从建国时就选址了的单位。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "到现在多少年了，扩建啥？往哪扩？", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你们当地的第一、第二、第三、第四、第五……人民医院都在哪？", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所谓“扩建”，基本上都是把老楼拆了盖新楼——直接加盖都不行，因为老房子地基受不了。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你走进随便哪家三甲医院看看，看看有几家有地方“扩建”？", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "每家门口都堵车，每家都停车难，每一家都人头爆满。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "难道你觉得现在的医院里还能增加床位？", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你是要把病床改成高低床吗？", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "是不是完全脱离实际？", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 511}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这就是不通实务的人可以荒谬到什么程度。", "char_start": 513, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "看似我这说的是老胡，但实际上我说的是你们。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "以后记住，不要听没有实务经验的人的治国方略或者政治主张。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "因为没有意义。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 592}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "同时，如果你自己没有三四十岁，没有做出点什么，不要发表——甚至不要持有——什么政治主张。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你要做的唯一的努力就是学习和怀疑。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "别看你好像“没有立场，没有主张”，但单凭优秀的怀疑能力，你轻易就能把某些振振有词、慷慨激昂的“志士”问得哑口无言。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 713}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你就问ta“实际上要怎么操作”。", "char_start": 714, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "原来你没方案，不知道要怎么办。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你不知道要怎么做的事，你这么坚决，是啥意思？", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你说不清的主张，你这么激烈，是啥意思？", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "纯属浪费时间和表情。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 800}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "顺便，这里每一个神神秘秘暗示“不建方舱怎么搞钱”的人，都不但是缺少常识，而且对自己的言论根本没有责任意识。", "char_start": 802, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你们自己想想，这样的信息源该不该保留。", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 875}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/29/d5f545826355cbf78d2f6ad4d56f8f22.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-11/29/339351b68e96c0fe6973d5d940d28613.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 45, "image": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待胡锡进建议「各地不要继续大规模建方舱医院，省下的钱用于增加正规医院的床位」？可能带来哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036"], "summary": "围绕“扩建医院”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“老胡的治理经验有哪些？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "老胡的治理经验有哪些？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e2570c53-5c17-559f-a5e3-8e402813dddf", "source_ordinal": 2506, "reading_ordinal": 1547, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "残疾", "published_at": "2022-11-30T19:56:53+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/568209621/answer/2781929767"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没人会鼓励你一辈子的，很快这种“困扰”就过去了。不需要你做任何努力，这些也会很快平息。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "大部分残疾人的生活是很安静的，何止“没人来激励”，简直就是“没人来”。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "把精力放在怎么更好的生活上吧。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "曾经给一个盲校小孩读过几年书，就是每到周末就带本书去读给ta听，再就是陪ta聊聊天，出去走几步。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这段期间见过很多盲人青少年。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "除了先天原因失明的之外，很显然很少有自己导致自己失明的。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "比如听读的这个，就是因为用药错误导致的，事发时不过初中左右的年纪。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这几年里面，几乎每周都会去，所以下面的观察完全不是什么特殊表演。", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这么说吧，这帮娃跟一般的小孩没啥大区别。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一样是一群又傻又欠揍的小猴子。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "次次去都有一帮子小猴崽子在教室外面嘻嘻哈哈打闹。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "ta们一般专业是搞中医推拿和调音去了。（神奇的是ta们居然要上针灸课）", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "因为是科班出身，还加上残疾加持——很多人相信盲人的听力就是好，外加给他们生意做天然的有慈善性质，他们出路也还可以。薪酬甚至还不算低。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "别人常觉得我对这个盲人小孩做了多么大的帮助，实际上是ta对我有巨大的帮助。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 460}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "恰恰因为ta和ta的同学们，从那个时候开始，我就不怎么恐惧意外伤残问题了。", "char_start": 461, "char_end": 498}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "志坚不必待身残了。", "char_start": 499, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这没有什么神奇的顿悟时刻，也没什么“强大的斗志所感动”——这帮小孩也没活得咬牙切齿、战天斗地，ta们只是很平常的自自然然的生活。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 573}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "残疾了，总有另一种活法，一切都自有另一套解决方案，并不至于“再也不可能幸福了”。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这还不提现在的科学技术对很多残疾（尤其是肢体障碍）帮助很大。积极适应调整一下，现在比几十年前的不便少很多。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "甚至高位截瘫都可以借助先进的轮椅获得一定的行动能力。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "唯一导致人真的“再也不可能幸福”的，是人自己坚信“再也不可能幸福”的执念。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 735}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "某种意义上，这是一种对“肇事者”的下意识的报复。因为这样才能在最大意义上折磨对方。", "char_start": 736, "char_end": 777}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而肇事者的范围，不仅仅只有直接坏事的这个人，还包括所有本来应该管住这个人的人，所有应该保护住自己的人，所有应该帮助他们来保护住自己的人……", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 847}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "几个循环关联，“肇事者”实际上就覆盖了全人类。", "char_start": 848, "char_end": 871}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这个怨念可以理解——世俗的现代教育中其实暗暗的隐含着这样的mindset。", "char_start": 872, "char_end": 909}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "想要人一下就超脱它的影响，那是强人所难。", "char_start": 910, "char_end": 930}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "但是它终究是无益的，只会让你无法像那群小孩一样继续享受仍然可以享受的生活。", "char_start": 931, "char_end": 968}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "祝你早日收拾心情，放下这个执念，从这些情绪里脱离出来，早日走上正循环。", "char_start": 970, "char_end": 1005}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "天无绝人之路，前头自有光明。", "char_start": 1007, "char_end": 1021}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：亲戚酒驾导致我截肢，我认为半摆烂式的活下去就已经能算可以了，一些人对这种生活态度有看法的原因是什么?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“残疾”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没人会鼓励你一辈子的，很快这种“困扰”就过去了。不需要你做任何努力，这些也会很快平息。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没人会鼓励你一辈子的，很快这种“困扰”就过去了。不需要你做任何努力，这些也会很快平息。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "17fad4ea-0112-5131-9279-87be21ab1b0c", "source_ordinal": 2505, "reading_ordinal": 1548, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "真正的朋友", "published_at": "2022-12-02T08:29:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/568983457/answer/2783626399"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "只有舍命的人，才有真正的朋友。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "做得到这一点，已经是超凡脱俗的人。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "做不到，自然不算是失败，更谈不上“很失败”。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你这辈子，只要有那么一瞬间过了这条线，而此时恰好是为了一个朋友，你就已经在那一瞬间有一个真正的朋友。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "哪怕是因为冲动、幼稚、傲慢甚至愚蠢，都可以算数。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "就这一瞬间，已经胜却人间无数。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "看了半天，这有可能是指要拥有一个或者曾经、或者正在、或者将来为你舍命的朋友。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果是这种的话，", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "既然你看得见这篇东西，", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你已经有了。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 217}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：没有真正的朋友是不是很失败呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“真正的朋友”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“只有舍命的人，才有真正的朋友。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "只有舍命的人，才有真正的朋友。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cc5afe46-bf23-5261-a2a3-310299f83fe2", "source_ordinal": 2504, "reading_ordinal": 1549, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "婚姻与稳定", "published_at": "2022-12-03T17:57:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/570130620/answer/2785687052"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为我们处在战争状态，对手既强大，又不遵守任何道德原则，可以制造巨大的不确定性。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "它正视图以这种不确定性本身作为主要武器赢得战争。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这一点再加上疫情本身带来的巨大变数，对结婚率有了明显的影响。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "兵荒马乱自然少人结婚罢了。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果说婚姻减少的影响，主要是对社会的稳定性有影响。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个倒不是指“没结婚的人憋狠了会去烧杀掳掠”——说实话，这些人没这个能力和胆量，只不过说起来嘴响罢了。而且ta们也根本没有组织起来的能力。没能力组织，即使作乱也不过是抢劫案、谋杀案这类的个人犯罪。在现代的社会监控水平下，要追踪和处理并不困难。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这里说的也不是“有家室的人顾忌多，容易威吓和控制”。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这里说的是婚姻关系是一种特殊的“人格催熟剂”，它可以实质性的、有力的培养人长远看待问题和谨慎稳健处理问题的经验和技能。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 345}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "它可以培养社会稳定所必须的保守性。", "char_start": 346, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "没有这些经验的和技能的人，常常会将耐心、服从视为人格缺陷，甚至将稳定视为一种社会问题，迷信用“革命”、“推倒重来”解决问题。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 426}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以ta们有恋无爱，好处难久，而且更重要的是，只有“推倒”，没有“重来”。", "char_start": 427, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为刚到“重”，还没到“来”，就“推倒”了，所以哪来“重来”，全是“重推倒”。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "真正会影响社会稳定的，是社会的幼稚化、短视化。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但这个问题并不致命，因为当婚姻这个工具不好用，自然还有就业、社交等等其它工具可用。除此之外，最直接的工具——教育——本身也在提高之中。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "其他工具的强化可以补足婚姻削弱带来的影响。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "至于一些人心心念念所幻想的“国家要求我们生育”，基本没这回事。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "国家恐怕只会鼓励和创造条件让能生育和愿意生育的人生更多，把抱着这个思想的人的那一份一起生了。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "十几亿人口的国家，是没有“人口危机”可言的。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 720}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：2021 年我国初婚人数跌破 1200 万，为 37 年来新低，哪些原因造成？会产生什么影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“婚姻与稳定”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为我们处在战争状态，对手既强大，又不遵守任何道德原则，可以制造巨大的不确定性。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为我们处在战争状态，对手既强大，又不遵守任何道德原则，可以制造巨大的不确定性。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2f04cc32-b1e1-578b-a46b-84a482cd3955", "source_ordinal": 2503, "reading_ordinal": 1550, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "蚯蚓", "published_at": "2022-12-04T10:10:28+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/415936168/answer/2786400591"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "痛苦并不是一种刑罚，所以作为“痛苦的诱因”的弱小自然也不是一种罪。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "罪都不是，何谈原罪？", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "会这么说的反而不是那些强大的人，因为这些人很清楚弱者是得罪不起的，乱说这种蠢话跟用手拽老虎的舌头一样愚蠢。说这种话的恰恰总是一些可怜的人，ta们的可怜，并不是因为ta们弱小，而是因为ta们既弱小，又说这种蠢话。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "其实世界是保护——甚至偏爱——弱小者的。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "说得不好听一点，这个世界上如果有谁有点才能，那点才能都是被世界安排来替弱小者服苦役用的。这些长得壮的、脑袋聪明的要是不甘心接受这安排，下场最终要惨不堪言。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "弱小的人才是这个世界的心头好，强大的人反而是世界的“耗材”——苦累脏险的活，反而要这些人去顶去扛。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但受世界照顾的弱者，有一个要害条件，就是不允许怨恨自己的待遇。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "犹如小孩不能嫌妈做的饭难吃——子不可嫌家贫。给你的已经是最好的，如果这个最好的仍然不可能让你满足，不是因为东西不够好，或者对你不够照顾，而是因为你自己太贪婪。你自己画了一条自认为“起码”的线，没得到满足，你就要认定不公、认定不善。是在这样的mindset下，一些至愚之人要将一切痛苦都视作世界在强加罪名、滥施刑罚。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是从“一切痛苦都是刑罚”，才产生了“一切导致痛苦的都是罪”，才有“弱小就是罪”。ta们实际上是要借此栽一个残忍的罪名在世界身上，用作让ta们的“无痛快乐”期待落空的报复。", "char_start": 490, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "把痛苦看作刑罚的人，因为痛苦是恒在的，永远处在被“无故定罪”的屈辱、怨恨和恐惧之中。这样的人总在为不存在的“压迫”实施“反抗”，以这个子虚乌有的“反抗”名义将对ta人的侵占和掠夺正义化，合理化。ta们很自然的与世界失和，既自身抛弃世界，也为世界所抛弃。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 702}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这不难理解——谁想要莫名其妙的多个仇人和债主呢？谁喜欢呆在一个会自发的产生怨恨情绪——无论是怨恨谁——的人身边，和ta建立伦理羁绊？", "char_start": 703, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要知道，若是成为这样的人的朋友或者伙伴，就自然而然的要卷入ta的怨恨和冲突中。就譬如你有个兄弟特别容易和人争吵，出门买包烟都得你去帮ta跟人打一架。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "ta一天就要买三包烟，你受得了吗？", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 862}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "什么叫“自身抛弃世界，也为世界所抛弃”，看懂了吗？", "char_start": 863, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "一旦走到这个自弃世界，亦为世界所弃的地步，世界加在一般弱者身上的保护就解除了。剥夺这些自己抛弃世界于是被世界抛弃的弱者，并不会受到世界的立刻报复。", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 963}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这些人，就成了世界用来钓海怪的蚯蚓。", "char_start": 964, "char_end": 982}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "海怪其实仍然会被世界拿去下火锅。但是蚯蚓可是实实在在的被海怪吃掉了。", "char_start": 983, "char_end": 1017}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不是因为你弱小，而是因为你的贪婪导致世界抛弃了你。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1044}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "任何观点一旦会导致这样的结果，就意味着它的错误是绝对的，无可辩解的——辩解得通又如何？只不过这条蚯蚓口才很好罢了。这是“错误”的根本标准。所以，这话是错的，没有可争辩的余地。", "char_start": 1046, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要把痛苦视作一种刑罚，其实那是一种保护，那背后何止不是审判、刑罚，事实上还是唤醒和挽救。", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1179}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "好心当成驴肝肺，", "char_start": 1181, "char_end": 1189}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "明天请你吃火锅。", "char_start": 1190, "char_end": 1198}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0238"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何正确理解“弱小即是原罪”这句话？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“蚯蚓”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“痛苦并不是一种刑罚，所以作为“痛苦的诱因”的弱小自然也不是一种罪。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "痛苦并不是一种刑罚，所以作为“痛苦的诱因”的弱小自然也不是一种罪。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
